# RFC 0072: historical dogfood artifacts moved to S3-compatible blob
# storage at dogfood-historical/<dogfood_id>/<rel_path>. The old
# per-file overrides above (030/design/gemini, 043/build/.../HANDOFF.md)
# are subsumed by this broader exclusion. Recovered via
# `striatum corpus migrate-historical-dogfoods` round-trip in S3.
docs/dogfood/
# Keep the two index files git-tracked: they are not per-run scaffold
# bodies, they are the human-readable map of what each numbered run
# shipped.
!docs/dogfood/HISTORICAL.md
!docs/dogfood/FRICTION_LOG.md

.striatum/
.scratch/
